{% extends 'mail/layout.txt.twig' %}

{% block content %}
Hello {{ name }},

{% if recovery %}
Your account ({{ email }}) signed in to the control panel with a recovery code, instead of a code from the authenticator app on your phone. {{ codes_left }} recovery {{ codes_left == 1 ? 'code is' : 'codes are' }} left.
{% else %}
Your account ({{ email }}) signed in to the control panel from a browser it hasn't used before.
{% endif %}

When: {{ when }}
Browser: {{ browser }}{% if recovery and new_browser %} (new for your account){% endif %}
IP address: {{ ip }}

{% if recovery %}
If you've lost your phone, ask whoever looks after this website to reset your account, so you can set up the authenticator app again and get new recovery codes.
{% else %}
If this was you, there's nothing to do.
{% endif %}

If it wasn't you, someone has your password and a code: ask whoever looks after this website to reset your account straight away. On the server, that's: {{ reset }}
{% endblock %}

{% block why %}You get this because this is your account on the website's control panel. Slim Killer emails you when your account signs in from a new browser, or with a recovery code.{% endblock %}
